      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just one moment. it's everything. it's how i look at people and know i'm different, like there's a fundamental wrongness in me. it feels like i'm just waiting for everyone to realize it too. it would be so much easier if i just wasn't a factor anymore. if i just... disappeared. it feels like the only way to fix the mistake of being me is to just not be here.",
